			<</if>>
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>
	<<person>>【이가】 다음 라운드 비용을 지불하고 <<= either ("당신이 모르는","다른 나라 언어로 된","전에 들어본 것 같은")>> 노래를 선택한다.
	<br><br>
	<<if currentSkillValue('danceskill') gte 800>>
		<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
			<<case "meek">>
				The beat is fast and loud, but once you stop overthinking and let your body follow the rhythm, your steps come easily.
			<<case "shy">>
				The first few beats make you tense, but once the song settles in, you stop glancing at the crowd and let yourself move.
			<<case "polite">>
				You match the beat with practiced, tidy steps, your movements smooth and precise without looking stiff.
			<<case "flamboyant">>
				You throw yourself into the beat with stylish flourishes, letting your hands and hips trace the music in broad, playful lines.
			<<case "docile">>
				You follow the rhythm with soft, graceful movements that grow surer with every beat.
			<<case "confident">>
				You settle into the rhythm almost at once, dancing with clean, self-assured motions and the occasional daring flourish.
			<<case "bratty">>
