			<<case "flamboyant">>
				The song is loud and fast. You put on a spirited little show and draw a few amused glances from the crowd, but the <<persons>> still the stronger dancer. <<He>> finishes with the better score, leaving you smiling despite the loss.<<stress -6>><<lstress>>

