			<<case "confident">>
				The song is loud and fast. You throw yourself into it with real assurance, but the <<persons>> simply better and keeps you from ever quite catching up. Losing stings a little, though you can still admit the match was fun.<<stress -6>><<lstress>>

			<<case "bratty">>
