			<<default>>
				The song is loud and fast. You're <<= $danceskill gte 600 ? "good" : "alright">>, but the <<persons>> much better. Unsurprisingly, <<he>> gets a higher score than you. You have fun in any case.<<stress -6>><<lstress>>
		<</switch>>
	<<else>>
